        "TileImage": "$($repository a27afd9c-4187-4c9c-9785-f82d7e966f28).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47, and welcome back to Miami. Todays targets are Marcus Lindsday, Alexandra Smith, and Heidi Santoro, all of whom have been accused of defamation of our clients family. Marcus is a DJ and during a gig he started drinking heavily and mocked the clients family. Then Alexandra, she&apos;s a reality star. She caused a public scandal, and included the client&apos;s name in the scandal. Then Heidi, she&apos;s a social media user who made a &quot;humorous video&quot; mocking the client and his family. Have fun!",
